 R←Test_Misc_011(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;name;txt
⍝ Regression test: level-0 help (]cmd -?) must not be empty for any user command.
⍝ `ReportAllIssues` used to have no :Case at all, so it printed nothing.
⍝ Note that `Public` is NOT the list to use: it is the package's API, which holds
⍝ functions that are not user commands and therefore have no user command help.
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '∘∘∘ ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 :For name :In GetUserCommands
     txt←0 ##.GitHub.Help name
     →T.PassesIf 0<≢txt
 :EndFor

 R←T._OK
⍝Done
